    "descriptionEn": "This big-picture introduction shows the possibilities that chemistry opens up in everyday life, participation in society, study and work, and the positive prospects offered by the material ahead. The learner only chooses what sparks their curiosity or whether they wish to continue; subject-specific detail is neither required nor assessed here.",
